      "title": "Sustainable and Flood Resilient Engineering for Rural Areas Act"
    },
    {
      "note": "",
      "title": "To amend section 203 of the Robert T. Stafford Disaster Relief and Emergency Assistance Act to establish within the Building Resilient Infrastructure and Communities program a dedicated rural flood resilience supplemental allocation providing formula-based pass-through grants to rural communities through a set-aside from the Federal Emergency Management Agency Disaster Relief Fund, and for other purposes."
    }
